Package: selSurv
Title: Selective Inference Workflows for Penalized Cox Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lena", "Schemet", email = "lena.schemet@uni-a.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Sarah", "Friedrich-Welz", role = "aut"),
    person("Andreas", "Groll", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Research workflows for inference after Cox-Lasso screening. The package provides a unified interface for Cox-Lasso fitting, support-restricted refitting, split-sample inference, approximately debiased coefficient estimates, score-level bootstrap intervals, and model-based bootstrap intervals with fixed-support or re-selection workflows. The package distinguishes full-model, fixed-support, and zero-padded procedure-level targets.
